<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Sun Hung Kai Prop.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Sun Hung Kai Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it has launched 67 million American-style call warrants on shares of Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$86.21	 PREMIUM	 14.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.751	 GEARING	 5.18x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   27.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  27.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$90.75	 EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
